Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Creator step 3 action row wraps its steppers under 356px
 (#26)

The row is now flex-wrap with a small row gap, so on a 320px phone the two 44px steppers drop to their own line instead of overflowing the panel. Measured in Chromium at 320, 360 and 390 on a step 3 draft: no row overflows at any of them, page width equals the screen; the 360 and 390 rows are unchanged. DESIGN.md notes it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WaLz6UBTQ5XaTKSYwqeMKA
